				"title": "ChatCompletionRequest",
				"description": "Supported public OpenAI-compatible request fields.\n\nThis is deliberately a positive allowlist. LiteLLM mixes user-facing\nfields with credentials, URLs, retry knobs, fallback controls, and testing\nhooks in one loose kwargs surface; accepting arbitrary extras would let a\ncaller take ownership of server-side routing and transport policy. Values\ninside the safe inference allowlist intentionally remain untyped so the\nselected provider owns request validation."
